---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="relative">
  <Verticalgrid />
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16 mx-auto py-12 lg:py-12 relative space-y-24">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 mt-6 list-none lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-24">
      <div>
        <h2 class="mt-40 text-white text-2xl xl:text-3xl 2xl:text-5xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white">
          Full Stack Digital Wallet for your Store
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl xl:text-xl mt-4 text-vulcan-300 ">
            Complete stack of features to implement all types of acquisition and retention programs. Reward, incentive, cashback, coupon or store credit programs all rolled into one.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:mt-0 mt-12 h-full">
        <img
          alt="Lexington thumbnail"
          class="rounded-2xl shadow-vulcan-950/50 w-full"
          src="/assets/homepage/WP.png"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <ul
        class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 mt-6 list-none md:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-12 lg:mt-24"
        role="list">
        <li>
          <div>
            <div class="text-indigo-400">
            <img alt="" class="w-8" src="/assets/homepage/GC.svg"/>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-5 text-lg font-medium text-white pr-8 lg:text-xl">
              Gift cards
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-base text-vulcan-300">
            Allow users to add and redeem gift cards using the Google Wallet app, and send them a reminder whenever they’re nearby a physical store.
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap mt-6">
             <a href="" class="rounded-lg px-4 border py-2 text-sm font-semibold transition-all flex items-center justify-center bg-vulcan-900 text-white hover:text-indigo-400 h-10 border-vulcan-700">Get started</a>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <div class="text-indigo-400">
             <img alt="" class="w-8" py-4 src="/assets/homepage/LC.svg"/>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-5 text-lg font-medium text-white lg:text-xl">
              Loyalty cards
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-base text-vulcan-300">
           Create digital loyalty cards your customers can add to Google Wallet for convenient access to rewards and purchase history. Leverage Google’s enhanced location-based notifications, updates, and messaging for greater customer engagement.
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap mt-6">
             <a href="" class="rounded-lg px-4 border py-2 text-sm font-semibold transition-all flex items-center justify-center bg-vulcan-900 text-white hover:text-indigo-400 h-10 border-vulcan-700">Get started</a>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <div class="text-indigo-400">
              <img alt="" class="w-8" py-4 src="/assets/homepage/Instore-Pay.svg"/>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-5 text-lg font-medium text-white lg:text-xl">
            In-store payments
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-base text-vulcan-300">
            Give your customers a fast, simple way to pay in millions of places – online, in stores, and more. Bring together everything they need at checkout for a frictionless payment experience.
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap mt-6">
             <a href="" class="rounded-lg px-4 border py-2 text-sm font-semibold transition-all flex items-center justify-center bg-vulcan-900 text-white hover:text-indigo-400 h-10 border-vulcan-700">Get started</a>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <div class="text-indigo-400">
              <img alt="" class="w-8" py-4 src="/assets/homepage/offer.svg"/>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-5 text-lg font-medium text-white lg:text-xl">
            offers
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-base text-vulcan-300">
            Enable users to add offers from your webpage or app directly to Google Wallet. Implement enhanced features, like offer expiration notification and geofenced notifications to drive engagement with users.
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap mt-6">
             <a href="" class="rounded-lg px-4 border py-2 text-sm font-semibold transition-all flex items-center justify-center bg-vulcan-900 text-white hover:text-indigo-400 h-10 border-vulcan-700">Get started</a>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
